        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mahavir Singh Phogat, Geeta Phogat, Babita Kumari, Aparshakti Khurana, Aamir Khan\n- Films: Dangal, The Man from Snowy River II, The Man from Snowy River\n- Topics: biographical sports drama films, sequels, Bollywood debuts\n\nFacts:\n- The Man from Snowy River is a 1982 film.\n- The Man from Snowy River II is a 1988 Australian drama film and a sequel to The Man from Snowy River.\n- Dangal is a 2016 Indian Hindi-language biographical sports drama film.\n- Dangal is loosely based on the story of Mahavir Singh Phogat, an amateur wrestler who trains his daughters Geeta Phogat and Babita Kumari to become world-class wrestlers.\n- Aparshakti Khurana made his Bollywood debut with Aamir Khan's film Dangal.",
